CHANGES IN VERSION 1.1.1
--------------------------
BUG FIXES
    o Check JASPAR availability before DMR discovery when motif extraction is
      enabled, unless matching JASPAR PWMs are already cached.

    o Allow for spaces, backticks and backslashes in phenotype covariates names.

    o Allow for phenotype column called "condition" in the DMP calling helpers input (previously overwritten internally).
    
    o Allow for sample called "site" in the plot_dmrs heatmap plotter.

    o Removed naming collision in tabix reader, that dropped ID, Name, SCORE and other BED field names.


CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.14
--------------------------
SIGNIFICANT USER-VISIBLE CHANGES

    o Reduced size of produced CMEnt example vignette

CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.13
--------------------------

SIGNIFICANT USER-VISIBLE CHANGES

    o Move optional dependency installation to container setup, using the
      requested analysis inputs and genome. Package functions only check
      dependencies and provide installation instructions.

    o Ship the Dockerfile, CLI, and container setup scripts in inst/docker.

    o Document external tool installation and Windows limitations in INSTALL.

    o Replace donttest examples with small runnable examples and wrap long
      vignette prose and comments.

BUG FIXES

    o Select Circos example regions on the chromosomes represented in the
      bundled data and allow vignette plotting errors to surface.

CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.9
