NEW FEATURES

    o Initial Bioconductor submission of CMEnt.

SIGNIFICANT USER-VISIBLE CHANGES

    o Added Bioconductor installation instructions and example data attribution
      for package review.

BUG FIXES

    o Avoid changing installed script file permissions at package load time.

